0 !HELP Shape from catalog photo and elephant instruction p4/p12. Preserve mounting Z0, studded center beam faces +Z.
0 !HELP Curved swept panels, thicker rounded end plates and three molded ribs per wing; all dimensions image inferred.
0 !HELP Photo review 2026-10-15: DECOTOYS views confirm the central 4x10 beam, six top studs, three side holes, paired continuous curved skins, and raised outer tip lips; this candidate preserves those recognition cues and the Z0 mount.
0 !HELP Local authorized approximation; no measured interface/tolerance or official mesh.
0 !HELP 40 LDU stud pitch; body dimensions inferred. Holes are real open mesh; screw threads and fit are NOT exact.
